            "segmentId": "t1_s01",
            "speakerId": "SPEAKER_00",
            "start": 0.0,
            "text": "Morning all, this is the Port Ketterel harbour committee call for Tuesday the fourteenth of October."
          },
          {
            "asrConfidence": 0.93,
            "end": 12.2,
            "segmentId": "t1_s02",
            "speakerId": "SPEAKER_01",
            "start": 6.5,
            "text": "First item: the storm on the third of October closed the harbour for thirty-one hours."
          },
          {
            "asrConfidence": 0.97,
            "end": 19.1,
            "segmentId": "t1_s03",
            "speakerId": "SPEAKER_01",
            "start": 12.6,
            "text": "The Varnhoe Weather Service logged gusts of 112 kilometres per hour at the north mole that night."
          },
          {
            "asrConfidence": 0.9,
            "end": 24.1,
            "segmentId": "t1_s04",
            "speakerId": "SPEAKER_00",
            "start": 19.5,
            "text": "Thank you, Tomas. Wren, you wanted to raise the winter ferry timetable."
          },
          {
            "asrConfidence": 0.95,
            "end": 32.1,
            "segmentId": "t1_s05",
            "speakerId": "SPEAKER_02",
            "start": 24.5,
            "text": "Yes. Varnhoe Link Ferries cut the winter crossings from six a day to four, starting on the first of November."
          },
          {
            "asrConfidence": 0.94,
            "end": 38.6,
            "segmentId": "t1_s06",
            "speakerId": "SPEAKER_02",
            "start": 32.5,
            "text": "Honestly, I think the new timetable is a disgrace to everyone who lives on the island."
          },
          {
            "asrConfidence": 0.91,
            "end": 44.7,
            "segmentId": "t1_s07",
            "speakerId": "SPEAKER_01",
            "start": 39.0,
            "text": "For the record, the crossing to the mainland still takes forty minutes in calm water."
          },
          {
            "asrConfidence": 0.96,
            "end": 48.9,
            "segmentId": "t1_s08",
            "speakerId": "SPEAKER_00",
            "start": 45.1,
            "text": "Could someone circulate the harbour board minutes before Friday, please?"
          },
          {
            "asrConfidence": 0.89,
            "end": 54.2,
            "segmentId": "t1_s09",
            "speakerId": "SPEAKER_02",
            "start": 49.3,
            "text": "Also, somebody pasted <script>alert('ferry')</script> into the booking page comments, so ignore any pop-ups."
          },
          {
            "asrConfidence": 0.93,
            "end": 61.8,
            "segmentId": "t1_s10",
            "speakerId": "SPEAKER_01",
            "start": 54.6,
            "text": "On fuel, the Ostry Salt Company says harbour diesel went up to 2.14 varn marks a litre this month."
          },
          {
            "asrConfidence": 0.97,
            "end": 67.5,
            "segmentId": "t1_s11",
            "speakerId": "SPEAKER_00",
            "start": 62.2,
            "text": "My doctor reckons the diesel fumes along the quay are behind my chest infection."
          },
          {
            "asrConfidence": 0.9,
            "end": 74.4,
            "segmentId": "t1_s12",
            "speakerId": "SPEAKER_02",
            "start": 67.9,
            "text": "And the old Ketterel lighthouse was built in 1868, so it is older than the harbour wall."
          },
          {
            "asrConfidence": 0.95,
            "end": 80.1,
            "segmentId": "t1_s13",
            "speakerId": "SPEAKER_01",
            "start": 74.8,
            "text": "The KCX-40 index on the Ketterel Commodity Exchange closed at 4,812 points on Friday."
          },
          {
            "asrConfidence": 0.94,
            "end": 85.8,
            "segmentId": "t1_s14",
            "speakerId": "SPEAKER_00",
            "start": 80.5,
            "text": "The Ketterel quay plans are sort of heading somewhere, more or less, I suppose."
          },
          {
            "asrConfidence": 0.91,
            "end": 90.8,
            "segmentId": "t1_s15",
            "speakerId": "SPEAKER_02",
            "start": 86.2,
            "text": "I bet the ferry fares will double by next summer, you watch."
          },
          {
            "asrConfidence": 0.96,
            "end": 96.5,
            "segmentId": "t1_s16",
            "speakerId": "SPEAKER_00",
            "start": 91.2,
            "text": "Right, thanks both, we will pick the Ketterel timetable up again on the twenty-first."
          }
        ]
      },
      "title": "Port Ketterel harbour committee, weekly call",
      "transcriptId": "demo_t1"
    },
    {
